  "goodToKnow": "Dran is the spoken form of daran: 'on it' or 'at it'. Its most useful meaning is someone's turn: Wer ist dran? (Whose turn is it?), Du bist dran! (It's your turn!). Ich bin dran also means 'I'm on it' or 'I'm working on it'. Gut dran sein means to be well off, and Da ist was dran means 'There's something to it'."
